WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:01.360
Thank you.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.980
Thank you.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.320
We can't let the carburetor go to waste.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.030
We should have a repair factory nearby.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:37.130
Boss!

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.030
It's the Seimitsu machine company!

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:42.710
We're in trouble!

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:47.820
Hoho!

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.200
We should be able to sort out the parts here.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.620
All the robots working here.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.050
If we find them, we won't be able to do anything to the humans.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.420
Since we're here,

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:59.280
we don't have any other money.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:00.580
Let's see if it's true or not.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:39.900
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:28.080
Let's get it!

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:39.380
It's a robot factory.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:40.760
What's that sound?

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:43.310
I'll go there.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:54.180
What happened?

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.880
Please tell me, what happened?

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.660
This is a Flanken.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:07.740
A Flanken?

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.150
I see.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.010
Then that strange sound just now was Flanken's.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.970
Flanken.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:17.770
It's a space-developing robot.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.760
This is a big deal.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.520
It hasn't been completed yet.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.470
If such a robot is violent to humans, it will be a big deal.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.180
Doctor, I'll look for it.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:28.900
Please.

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:45.760
Even so, Franklin will be involved in Sakai's work.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.750
Is that monster really going to listen to what I say?

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:53.710
Listen, the new robot is the same as a human or a baby.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.750
That's why you have to believe what the human says first.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:04:59.880
Listen, hurry up!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:25.710
Be careful, you bastard!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:32.450
Boss!

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:44.800
He's going to dig it out!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.300
Boss!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.720
Stop!

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:18.720
Frank, listen carefully. I am Skunk, your master.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:23.050
Do you understand? I am your master!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.020
Misako Hoshizora is very popular.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:02.520
I don't think she is a robot's talent.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:21.100
A popular robot girl, Misako Hoshizora has changed.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.440
She is doing a terrible thing.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.300
She must have some grudge against her.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.320
But Misako Hoshizora should not have any grudge against her.

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.810
If the robot is destroyed like this, it must be the work of Franken!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.580
The diamond! The diamond of the diamond!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.920
Diamond? Will the robot steal a diamond?

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:45.380
I don't know about that! Anyway, it's a big deal, Atom!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.910
Your robot has finally released a criminal!

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:53.810
That's right! That's why I've always said that robots are dangerous!

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:56.370
Hey, Mr. Tawashi! That's a bit of a conjecture!

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.140
No! It's too late if the damage comes from humans!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.100
That's too much! It's going to be a big deal!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:07.860
The jewelry store, bank, and Franken's crimes are intensifying,

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.500
but there are even more risks.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.100
On the other hand, the police are doing their best

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.890
to continue the search for Franken.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.200
On the eve of this incident,

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:18.360
they suddenly issued a law on manufacturing regulations

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.900
against incomplete robots to the parliament.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.640
Already, in the citizens,

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:23.460
in order to prevent danger,

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.880
there are more and more people who use the energy of the robots,

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.780
and in the shops around the country,

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:29.820
Next time, we'll take a closer look at what's going on with the Self-Defense Force.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.500
has begun to be created.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:35.090
Everyone, please take care of yourselves.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.310
Detective Tawashi,

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.790
isn't it too much to take out the energy of all the robots?

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:44.060
No, if other robots also start to rampage,

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:44.920
it will be a great riot.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.640
Such stupid robots are miserable.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:48.700
That's right.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.280
Even if it's Franken,

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.180
it's no use for me.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:51.920
Shut up!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:52.780
Don't talk nonsense!

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:54.740
No, it's what Atom said.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:58.600
Probably, Franken is being manipulated by someone.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:08:59.420
What?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.820
What? It's being controlled?

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:04.750
No matter how unfinished it is, the robot won't steal the jewel or the gold.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.790
I'm investigating the bloodline of Flanken right now.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.940
If I find it, I'll immediately...

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:12.340
No, I'll wait for a while.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.820
Ah, it's a waste of time. I'll find it for sure.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:24.270
I haven't done anything, Mr. Manager!

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:25.470
It's reckless to drain the energy!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:28.950
It's not a robot's cup, it's a customer's cup!

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.560
Now, you should wake up too.

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:35.120
I-I didn't do anything wrong!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.360
About the change in the activities of the robots that take care of the lives of the people,

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.930
I thought it was very unpleasant.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:46.370
From now on, you guys don't need to worry about the machines!

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.320
You guys just sleep in the warehouse!

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.920
It's not our responsibility, but it's for business!

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.040
Ah, let's take a break for a while!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.280
The robots have all disappeared in a flash.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:16.020
It's easier to get a job.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:16.900
I can't even wish for it.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.880
It's all thanks to the cute Franken.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:33.710
Atom, wait!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:37.290
What is it? What's wrong?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.610
He's not feeling well, is he?

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:39.860
Yeah...

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:42.050
Oh, it's the chief's son-in-law!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:45.880
You little brat! You're a robot too, aren't you?

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.380
You need to apologize to him politely!

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:48.960
I-I'm sorry for what I did earlier...

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.380
Bal! I'm sorry, but you don't need to apologize!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.020
Stop it!

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:57.010
It's Atom!

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:58.090
Don't get in my way!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.190
No!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.360
This is my father's...

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:02.880
What did you say?

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:06.600
It's perfect.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.120
If both of you go to the doctor, you'll lose your energy.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:10.380
Huh?

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:16.570
If there are two dangerous robots in school, we won't be able to study well.

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.570
That's terrible!

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.530
Oh, are you going to hit me?

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.990
A-Atom...

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.880
Interesting. I'll get you to hit me.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:26.840
Atom, please stop.

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:29.940
The robot...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.740
Then what will happen if you touch a human?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.120
You know that, don't you?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:37.780
That's right. It's a chance to do something.

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:39.730
You guys are robots, aren't you?

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.270
Hey, hey, hey!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.070
Stop it! Stop it, both of you!

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:48.540
You're going the wrong way!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.180
Did you say something?

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.690
Humans and robots are equal!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:54.360
Don't fight over trivial things!

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:02.500
Cheer up!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.300
What's that?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:15.260
There's a strange sound in the room!

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.240
Alright! I'll turn the volume of my earphones to 1000x!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.000
I'm here to deliver Rodan's sculpture.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.420
You're late.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.410
It's been three days since we promised.

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:52.720
I'm really sorry.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:57.000
I thought you wouldn't be able to do it.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.700
But it's a wonderful work.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:01.600
Good, good.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:09.170
With this, my school's art museum will be in full swing.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.980
I don't know if it's a rodan or a stone, Papa.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.600
I've been bribed by a fake before, haven't I?

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.750
If you don't know the value of 100 million yen, you can't help it.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:29.490
Master, you're still on leave.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:31.520
Wow!

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:36.140
Wow!

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:45.870
That's the Flanken!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.680
That's the Flanken!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:48.100
Yeah!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.980
Thank you.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:53.930
The jewel!

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.300
This guy lost to the sculpture!

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:58.020
The jewel is...

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.180
Atom!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.260
You too, Atom?

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.240
No, it's not me!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.620
Shut up! Why are you here if it's not you?

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:07.960
Huh? What's going on?

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:09.020
Papa!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.950
Atom, how could you do this?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.340
I'm sorry! I heard Franken's voice, so I came here!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:18.200
Don't say such things!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.080
I see. You were also a member of Franken, right?

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:21.780
Y-Yes.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.150
This is terrible! Everyone...

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.120
Atom was arrested for collusion with Franken.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.440
After that, the police conducted a thorough investigation.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:36.070
Dr. Ochanomizu's hands were asked to remove the energy by considering the suspicion against the robot and the same as the theory of Ceylon.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.120
Dr. Ochanomizu, please remove the energy.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.820
Atom?

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:50.600
I'm sorry, Atom. Please forgive me.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.620
Even while I'm like this, Flanken is...

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:09.550
Flanken, why?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.320
Why do we have eyes like this?

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:15.380
Mom!

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:00.940
What's going on, Franken?

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:21.370
The violent Franken is heading for Fukdoshin.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.480
Those around him, please evacuate immediately.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:24.880
It's a disaster.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:27.960
The violent Franken is heading for Fukdoshin.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.970
Those around him, please evacuate immediately.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:35.300
Atom! Atom, please wake up!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:42.010
Dr. Uchanomizu!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.160
Atom, are you awake?

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:45.620
Atom!

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:50.540
Atom, you're the only one who can install this new circuit to Flanken!

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.880
Oh, Flanken!

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:08.020
What's wrong with the robot fire brigade? Call the fire brigade!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:09.340
I know, Hans!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.940
The robots are all running out of energy!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.730
At this critical moment!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:15.060
What should we do?

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:15.880
I'm not a human!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.220
I'm going to put energy into the robot!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.120
Thank you.

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.950
Flanken, what you did is a good thing, isn't it?

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:22.650
Let's get rid of the robot!

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.540
Flanken, can you tell me the taste of the gang that used you?

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:39.030
Wow!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:44.810
Let's get out of here!

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:53.510
Wow!

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:07.290
I was too late!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:27.740
The boss of the gang has escaped!

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:29.680
Atom, well done!

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.400
I want you to understand that we are not robots!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:37.290
Of course! It's obvious! Right, Detective Tawashi?

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.890
Gentlemen! Let me tell you something!

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:44.850
It's a gang of human shits who used the Flanken!

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:49.530
It was wrong for the humans to be lazy and entrust the robot only to the maintenance department!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:53.350
You humans! Know your place!

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.010
That's right.

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:59.300
I'm glad, I'm glad. You did a good job.

00:21:59.300 --> 00:21:59.680
Let's go up.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:21:59.880
Go up?

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:05.240
It would be great if you could let your father and mother know about your ID card as soon as possible.

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:06.120
Yes, I will!

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:31.100
Sasaga No.13

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:34.650
This is a scary haunted house.

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:36.620
Five boys are kidnapped one after another.

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:39.620
And there is...

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:41.170
What? Isn't it a cat?

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:43.200
What? What did you say?

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:46.760
A very scary thing happens on November 19th.

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:48.800
Red Iron Atom

00:22:48.800 --> 00:22:49.600
Red Cat

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:50.700
Look forward to it!
